  "not a claim that all 42 refusals are resolvable: 19 had no binding in the guide that reproduced its output, 5 named no missing name, 5 were ambiguous",
  "not a learned rule in weights: a binding is an observed fact in an external receipt",
  "not information gain: the ranking is a computed prior over probe ORDER; the guide's printed output is the oracle that decides the answer",
  "not independent verification: one producer, one machine, one stdlib version"
 ],
 "limits": [
  "the candidate pool is the six stdlib guides and three READMEs in default_guides()",
  "a binding that needs a session state established in a different module is not found",
  "the decoy mutates one literal in the binding; a binding with no literal is reported UNMUTABLE rather than counted as separated",
  "a guide's printed output is version-matched only when guide and library are the same version; neither is pinned here"
 ]
}
